    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d661">

                <pb facs="0891" n="789" xml:id="pg789"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">765.84/604: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Ethiopia</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">George</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Addis Ababa</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1935-07-23T12:00:00+02:35">July 23,
                            1935—noon</date>.<lb/>[Received July 23—8:50 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>61. Italian Minister, protesting Emperor’s latest speech, declined to attend
                    official reception or dinner Emperor’s birthday today. Rupture of diplomatic
                    relations may result. I was most graciously received at impressive ceremonies
                    this morning at Palace and returning therefrom loudly acclaimed all along route
                    by cries of Live America.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">George</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
